# Purpose

This document defines how Next.js is used throughout the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish consistent architectural decisions that maximize the capabilities of the App Router while maintaining scalability, security, and long-term maintainability.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Next.js architecture
* Rendering strategy
* Server and Client responsibilities
* Data fetching principles
* Routing architecture
* Rendering performance
* Platform governance

It intentionally excludes React fundamentals, component design, styling conventions, and business implementation, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to the Next.js platform by establishing consistent architectural patterns that improve scalability, maintainability, and operational reliability.

